    "limited ": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限速 "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qB bans an IP after repeated failed logins, so the app won’t retry on its own. Click Test Connection after fixing it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qB 连续登录失败会封 IP，所以 app 不会自动重试。改好后点「测试连接」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qB returns 401 in all of these cases and the app can’t tell them apart. Check in order:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qB 在下面几种情况下都返回 401，app 分不出是哪一种，按顺序排查："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qBittorrent": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "qBittorrent always moves files when changing the save path": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qBittorrent 改保存路径时总会移动文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "qBittorrent has no low file priority": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "qBittorrent 的文件优先级没有「低」这一档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "skipped %lld (Flood has no per-torrent limits)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过 %lld 个（Flood 不能按种子限速）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "skipped %lld (only qBittorrent has categories)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过 %lld 个（只有 qBittorrent 有分类）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "skipped %lld (the client always moves files when changing the path)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跳过 %lld 个（下载器改路径时总会移动文件）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "some servers are offline": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有服务器不在线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· type can’t be changed after creation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· 创建后不能改类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• The port in the Host header doesn’t match the WebUI port (common with Docker port mapping or a reverse proxy): make them match, or turn off Host header validation in qB": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• Host 头里的端口和 WebUI 端口不一致（Docker 端口映射或反代时常见）：让两边端口一致，或在 qB 里关掉 Host 头校验"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• The reverse proxy forwards its own Basic Auth (Authorization header) to qB: qB 5.x rejects it, so strip that header in the proxy": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 反代把自己的 Basic Auth（Authorization 头）转给了 qB：qB 5.x 会拒绝，在反代里去掉这个头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• Wrong username or password": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• 用户名或密码不对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
